Subject: [PATCHv2 2/4] arm64: dts: qcom: msm8996: Add Coresight support
Date:   Fri, 18 Jan 2019 13:55:38 +0530
Message-Id: <552e408950525b1bac39d05b8b4f2ae1975397e0.1547798966.git.saiprakash.ranjan@codeaurora.org>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.19.2
In-Reply-To: <cover.1547798966.git.saiprakash.ranjan@codeaurora.org>
References: <cover.1547798966.git.saiprakash.ranjan@codeaurora.org>
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit
